  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I love the new size changing feature, it's really awesome. However, the fact size is determined by the view position instead of the avatar's actual size is quite a shame, often times avatar's sizes will not match because of that.\n\nI thus propose that a new \"position\" type field is added to the VRChat SDK, a 'top of the head' position, that would indicate more clearly the actual size of the avatar. \n\nI believe the view position system for resizing is not to be discarded, especially for matching one's eye height, but having height be decided upon the avatar's actual height and being able to also match that height would also be quite appreciated.",
